===================================================================

Plan2001 is a from-scratch modernization of 9front's (a Plan 9 from Bell
Labs fork, https://9front.org/) x86-64 UEFI boot path. It is built by
taking 9front's own source tree as a base (fetched fresh from a live
9front installation at build time, see README.md) and overlaying a small
set of rewritten/new files (see sys/ in this repository).

This software is derived from Plan 9, originally copyright Lucent
Technologies and distributed under the Lucent Public License, Version
1.02. Lucent was bought by Alcatel (Alcatel-Lucent), which was bought by
Nokia. On March 23, 2021, Nokia announced the transfer of the Plan 9
copyrights to the Plan 9 Foundation, which in turn relicensed Plan 9
under the MIT license, reproduced above. 9front's own additions and
changes on top of Plan 9 are likewise provided under the MIT license.

Plan2001's own additions and modifications (the files under sys/ in this
repository, and everything under tools/ and docs/) are provided under
the same MIT license, by Petteri Reunamo.
